    <div class="faq__list">
      <details class="faq__item" open>
        <summary>How fast will I see results?</summary>
        <p>Most people notice a visibly brighter smile in as little as 7 days with the whitening strips, using them just 30 minutes a day. Results vary with your starting shade and habits like coffee, tea and wine.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Will it hurt or make my teeth sensitive?</summary>
        <p>Our strips are peroxide-free and designed to whiten with dramatically less of the zing and sensitivity that traditional strips cause. The toothpaste is a gentle, low-abrasion formula that won't strip your enamel.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Is LumySmile safe for enamel and gums?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Everything we make is enamel-safe and gum-friendly &mdash; it brightens without damaging or weakening your teeth. If you have specific dental concerns, we always recommend checking with your dentist first.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Are your products natural and eco-friendly?</summary>
        <p>They're built around natural ingredients like activated charcoal and coconut oil, free from artificial dyes and harsh additives. Our bamboo toothbrushes use a biodegradable handle and BPA-free bristles.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>How long does whitening last?</summary>
        <p>With regular maintenance &mdash; brushing with the charcoal toothpaste and occasional strip touch-ups &mdash; your brighter smile can last for months. Diet plays a big role, so lighter on the coffee and red wine helps.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Where do you ship and how long does it take?</summary>
        <p>We offer fast tracked shipping across the US &amp; Canada, free on orders over 50$. Orders are processed within 1&ndash;3 business days and typically arrive within 3&ndash;7 business days, with tracking emailed to you.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>What's your return policy?</summary>
        <p>Every order is backed by our 30-day money-back satisfaction guarantee. If you're not happy, contact us within 30 days of delivery and we'll make it right.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

